WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:37.450
I am Kurata Sana, a first-year
student at Jinbo Middle School.

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:41.240
Winner of Aoki award, Mama and the squirrel Maro-chan.

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:44.250
The one who has had a happy
reunion with Takaishi-kun, Fuka.

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:45.960
Fuka.

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:48.670
Takaishi-kun,
what are you doing here?

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:51.750
I... broke up with Shizu-chan.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:58.430
My heart... belongs to you alone.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:06.930
And there is manager-driver, Rei-kun.

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:12.440
Adult Love...
that Could Wait!

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:16.400
But Takaishi-kun, he is very stupid.
Let me tell you...

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:18.360
Ok, ok.

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:21.240
Do you think the two of us are
having a long-distance relationship?

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.200
Yeah, yeah, of course...

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.040
Everyday we have so much talk about...
the phone bill is becoming so expensive!

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.370
Is that so...

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:30.040
So he sent me a record!

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:32.540
Look, it's so long!

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:36.800
And he sent me pictures to go with it, and told me to wait for the next one.

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:41.720
Haha, I really don't know what
the heck he is about!

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:42.470
I don't know what he is
about either...

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:46.180
Oof, I am so hungry,
please just let me go...

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:48.730
She's lost in the river of love...
does it really bring such happiness?

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:52.770
Few people can be patient when
they listened to other people's love stories.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:56.570
Hey you! You don't listen when
other people talk to you? How rude!

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:58.990
Are you happy?

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:59.400
If it can smooth develop,
it will be good.

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:01.740
Kodocha is getting some very good
reviews!

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:04.490
Yeah, you've brought good luck for us.

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:09.540
However, being both an actress and
a student must be very hard.

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:13.630
If you miss any schoolwork we would all do our best to help you.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:16.130
Thank you,
but I've already decided.

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:18.340
I won't miss school.

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:21.380
You said the same thing before.
Can you really do that?

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:22.760
I'll try my best.

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:25.760
Before, I took way too many leaves
of absences.

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:28.930
I regret now that I didn't focus
more on school.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:31.230
Going to school is all very good,
of course.

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:34.940
But whatever you missed before,
I'll help learn it.

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:37.110
I thank you for your help.

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:40.820
So now, you have to listen to me talk
about Takaishi-kun.

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.280
Eh?! There's more?!

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:43.110
Of course!

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:45.120
- Sana-chan, let's get going.
- Lucky!

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:49.160
Can't be helped, I have to go, Fuka! Hey, wait for me!

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:50.330
Sana...

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:54.380
It seems she doesn't like it when
I talk about Takaishi-kun.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.130
Of course she doesn't!

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.760
What's going on, Rei-kun?
You look so happy, humming like that.

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:03.590
Yeah, there might be a good show
for you to act in.

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:06.050
It's an educational yet
entertaining show.

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:10.020
It's called Don't Best Around the
Bush, I know about it's a word game.

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:11.600
Can I really get on that show?

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:15.520
There's a very good chance.
We'll know by the end of day.

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:20.530
Many people watch that show,
it gets very good reviews.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:23.990
If you can get on this show permanently you will be very busy again.

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:26.490
But I don't want to miss school.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:28.160
I know, don't worry.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.450
- I'll help you plan everything.
- You will?

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:36.130
I'll take care of the financial part, and restrict the areas you can waste your time

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:41.090
so you can go to school like a normal
student, and have time for yourself.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:44.300
So you'll enjoy working.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:49.810
What do you mean?

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:53.230
Really, I have to learn how to do
that from you.

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:57.360
I'm your business manager,

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:59.020
you're my work companion.

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:00.530
Partner and
colleague

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:01.280
They spell like this.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.660
Thanks everyone for your concern.

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:08.570
No, we can't believe you're
leaving, Asako-chan.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:10.120
Please forgive me.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:12.200
We are very sorry indeed.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:14.830
If you go, our show will be in
jeopardy.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:18.790
I want to go see the world a bit,
study, and then come back.

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.380
When she comes back,
we will be at your disposal.

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:24.220
Ah well,
then please return quickly.

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:26.050
Ok, thank you.

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:27.720
Well then, let's go.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:29.680
I'm leaving now.

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.220
Good luck on your journey.

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:34.270
- After this...
- I'm going to Shibuya.

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:36.390
Must be nice being an actress.

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:39.150
They could go to London
on study trips.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:41.150
What's there to study?

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:43.650
It'll be hard for her to find a
job when she comes back.

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:46.570
Fame is like that, an actor could
lose it all if she were absent for 3 months.

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:48.530
Goodbye, Asako-chan.

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:51.660
This is a little gift from the
company, please don't mention it.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:54.620
Thank you. Kinoshita-sama, please take care of yourself.

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:07.010
Will I miss it?
Tokyo... goodbye for now.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:18.770
Looks like Rei.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:22.730
Is the call phone broken?
How come there are no calls?

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:24.730
Are you still waiting for
them to call?

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:27.740
Yes! They're late by 2 hours!

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:31.620
- Let's call them.
- Business etiquette says we can't call them.

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:33.780
And I just got
this new cell phone too.

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.750
Can it be broken?

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:38.660
The phone is ringing!
Sensei, just a sec.

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:41.960
Yes, I'm Kurata Sana's manager, Sagami Rei, how are you?

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:44.420
Rei, it's me.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.630
Ah? Why is it Asako?

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:49.800
I'm leaving the day after next.

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:52.890
Can I see you today? I would
really like to see you and talk to you.

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:56.180
I'm waiting for an urgent
call. Call me tonight.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:57.390
Huh? Rei?!

00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:00.140
What are all these random phone
calls when I'm busy!

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:03.270
You're so cold to Asako-san.
You're not being very nice.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.440
It's work first, right now.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.070
Hey, Sagami-kun...

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:08.240
Yes, what is it?

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:10.450
That is, on the afternoon of the
day after tomorrow, I...

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:14.530
Yes, I'm Sagami, I've been waiting
for your call for a long time, sir!

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:18.750
It's busy...
Why is he acting like this?

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:22.750
I'm leaving the day after tomorrow.
He really knows to take things slow now.

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:23.830
What?

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:25.880
Oh, really?

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:29.380
This is excellent! Now your
talents will be really appreciated.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:31.130
It rocks! Rei-kun, you're great!

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.470
And, listen to this.

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:35.050
You're not going to be just a guest
star, but the sidekick to the show host!

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:36.560
Oh really? Cool.

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:41.190
The original sidekick is going to
be married, that's why.

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:43.520
Eh? She's going to get married?
To whom?

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:48.480
Everyone is still wondering who's
gonna take this position, we're so lucky!

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:51.700
Sana-chan, you're not getting
married, are you?

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:54.870
Listen to me!

00:07:56.830 --> 00:08:00.250
There'll be some people coming to
interview me the day after tomorrow.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.000
The topic will be the author's family.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:04.670
Author's family?

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:09.010
This is very normal. They do this
to introduce popular authors to the world.

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:12.220
Me, Sana of course, Shimura-san...

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:17.180
...and of course Sagami is going
to be interviewed too, as well as Maro-chan.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:20.020
Ah, would I be in the photo?

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:21.520
Of course.

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:24.190
If you're not in it, then it would
all be meaningless.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:28.230
The time is at 4 pm, does it
interfere with your schedule?

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:30.860
It should be fine.

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:32.950
Right, so it' decided.

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:37.700
Let's do it that way. Hmm, what sort
of hairstyle should I have...

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:41.040
How about a chicken nest...
will it look too exaggerated?

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.290
Family...

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:49.840
That phrase that
I have tried to forget...

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:53.760
I'm an orphan, alone in the world.

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:11.030
After three years of tool, finally,
I have a family again.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:14.450
I have a family again.

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:21.870
Hello?

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:23.540
Ah, it's Asako. What is it?

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:25.960
It's you who told me to call you
tonight.

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:27.420
Oh, yeah.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:28.710
Are you ready then?

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.460
Ready?

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:32.550
I want to see you before I leave.

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:35.010
Leave? What are you talking about?

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:37.220
Rei, are you listening? Rei?

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:39.850
Let's meet tomorrow.
Tomorrow is the last day.

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:42.850
Oh, ok, I will find you tomorrow
then.

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:45.230
Confused people like Rei-kun.

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:48.650
Please review episode no 91
'Visitors on New Year's Day' for information.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:49.520
Bye bye.

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:52.480
Next
day

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:54.650
Um, got get Sana at 2:00.

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:57.280
Before that, telephone
the director of that show.

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:59.450
I must set an alarm for that.

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.910
This is Asako-san's apartment.

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:07.120
I thought I'd have to wait until
the day I leave before I get to see you.

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.790
I just finished packing
everything.

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.670
Asako, are you moving?

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:12.000
What are you talking about?

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.460
We decided to send everything to the countryside.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.550
We're only bringing
some matching luggage.

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:19.510
If you want to drink coffee,
I'll make some more.

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:22.430
Look, I bought these
two cups in Shibuya.

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:24.310
It looks just like you.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:27.480
It's a little childish, but we could use it over there.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:31.860
I bought these to celebrate
our new life in London

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:33.860
but we could use it now anyways.

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:37.650
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:45.540
You...

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:50.420
It can't be...
You haven't forgotten, have you?

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:51.580
What?

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:54.460
- You really forgot.
- What are you talking about?

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:56.380
Our New Year's agreement!

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:58.670
New Year? New Year...

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:00.590
Look...

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:03.550
I want to go to
acting classes in London.

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:04.810
London!

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:06.890
Don't you want to come with me?

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:11.600
You're going to come with me to
London, aren't you?

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:13.230
Yes...

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:14.320
It's not of my hands.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:18.530
You're joking, right? Stop it.

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:21.530
Ahh... ah, that was...

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:26.240
And afterwards, I've mentioned
this to you many other times as well.

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:28.040
New life in London?

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.540
Yes, after we arrive we should live in a hotel first.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:33.040
And then look around for a house,
how's that?

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:35.920
That's good,
I heard life in London is great.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.710
Ah, sorry,
we're filming right now.

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:39.920
Hey, you should do this
at that part...

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:41.880
- Hey, Rei.
- Asako.

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:43.390
Are you packed for our trip?

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:45.350
Have you seen the director?

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:48.520
These are a collection of Sana's
best work, I want him to take a look at them.

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:51.140
Oh, he's on the fourth floor.

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:56.650
Really? Thank you!
I know I can rely on Asako!

00:11:57.440 --> 00:12:00.240
Rei, before we leave, I want to
talk about when specifically.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:04.660
It's all up to you, I don't care. When you have decided, just leave message on my call.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:06.120
Rei!

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:10.830
Did you forget...

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:13.750
You haven't heard a word I said!

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:15.920
I...

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:21.220
What? You didn't hear a single
thing I said about such an important event?

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:25.430
Even at the beginning, you were
barely paying attention to me.

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:30.180
At that time... New Year's Eve...

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:36.400
Sana-chan was out of work, and I
was in a very bad situation...

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:41.650
So I thought, living with Asako
in London would be a good alternative.

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:47.830
But now, Sana-chan has suddenly
became very excited about working.

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:51.290
I'm excited too, I want to help
her find more to do...

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.790
Sana-chan, Sana-chan, again...

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:58.920
I've reached my decision with
great difficulty.

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:04.840
I'm risking a lot!

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:10.560
I know how it is now!
Leave! Leave!

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:12.270
Go back to Sana-chan!

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:13.850
Goodbye.

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:34.960
Time to pick up Sana-chan!
Time to pick up Sana-chan!

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:52.310
Idiot!

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:59.270
I screwed up!

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:10.530
{parte b}

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:13.370
Today is a new day! Yay!

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:14.620
Sagami-san.

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:15.540
Yes?

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:19.080
I want to rearrange the living
room for the photo shoot.

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:20.630
Would you please help me?

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:23.340
Ok, when?

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:26.470
Starting at 2 in the afternoon.

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:27.880
Ok, I will.

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:30.260
There's no need to
be that excited.

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:33.220
Shimura-san is like that from
the beginning.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:36.180
And now, the only thing left for
me is work.

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:38.980
Good morning!

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:41.190
Ah, sir, hello, hello, it's all
thanks to your help.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:42.400
No problem, Sagami-san!

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:44.400
The feel of this apartment will be
like this...

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:46.780
This is the script for the second act?

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:49.320
The contract is valid for
the first year...

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:52.120
All right,
I see no problems with it.

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:53.990
- This is last one, right?
- Yes.

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:56.250
- Bye.
- Thank you all very much.

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:12.260
So you won't even call me? Idiot.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:15.260
Asako, have you already left...?

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:18.430
- Sagami-chan, come here.
- Yes.

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.560
No more time to waste.

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:25.320
I've really heard enough about
Takaishi-kun and Fuka's relationship.

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:28.570
She asked me if a long-distance
love relationship was sweeter than normal.

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:31.070
How am I supposed to know?

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:32.910
Are you listening, Rei-kun?

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:35.580
Oh, I should have asked her when
was she leaving.

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:40.750
Sagami-san, I would like this sofa
to be over there.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:43.170
Where do we put it?

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:47.500
When we're photographed, I want
the bookcase to be in the background.

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:50.260
Ah, I forgot
about the bonsai tree.

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:51.630
Oh, wait a minute.

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:53.430
Sagami-kun,
how does my hairstyle look?

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:54.470
It looks bad!

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:57.510
- Then I'll do the afro.
- Afro?

00:15:57.510 --> 00:16:00.180
Sagami-san,
doesn't this look better?

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:01.980
Shimura-san, please, the sofa.

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:03.480
Ah, I've forgotten all about it.

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:07.860
Oh yeah,
I should ask Asako's company.

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:12.070
Ah, Kinoshita-san, it's been a
long time, it's Sagami.

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:14.360
It's been since
the last filming session.

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:17.200
I heard Kurumi Asako-san is going to London.

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:20.200
Ah, you know?
We've been keeping it a secret.

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:21.500
Is that so?

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:24.630
Well then, may I ask when her
flight is leaving?

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:27.750
Today at 4:30, she should be at the
airport right now.

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:29.840
Eh? 4:30?

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:33.470
Sagami-san? Please help me.

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:35.300
Sorry, I need to go buy some
cigarettes.

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:38.180
Sagami-san! Sagami-san!

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:40.520
I have no choice now but
to do it by myself.

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:42.060
You could've done it alone!

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:43.980
What am I doing?

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:46.690
If I go now, I won't be on time
for the photo shoot.

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:48.730
Sagami, how does this look?

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:51.400
Sagami-san went to buy cigarettes.

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.610
What?

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:00.700
He hasn't come.

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:05.120
There's a huge traffic jam here.

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:13.050
Dammit, why is it like this?

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:14.880
Mama, what do you think?

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:19.140
I do not like strange clothing.

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:22.100
You look just as strange,
with your afro.

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:23.730
It's almost 4 clock.

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:25.940
Where is Sagami-kun going to buy
cigarettes?

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:28.150
- Rei-kun doesn't smoke.
- What?

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:29.150
This the airport.

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:34.190
This is the famous idol Naruru-san who has announced her engagement. Today, she will travel to Hawaii for her wedding ceremony.

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:36.950
Travel safely, Namuru-san,
and good luck.

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:41.290
If I turn back now, I can still be
on time for the photo shoot.

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:45.080
It was so hard for me to become a
member of a family again.

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:47.370
They should be more important to me.

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.090
Hey, man, where are you going?

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:54.130
Why, why am I running toward
the airport?

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:56.170
I'm back to my original
hairstyle.

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:58.260
This is more like it for
an interview.

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:00.640
The interviewers are here.

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:03.060
Shimura, change back to your
original appearance!

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:09.770
This has nothing to do with Rei after all.
I just want to go to London to study.

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:12.110
Is this how you really feel, Asako?

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:15.400
Or do you really want to go with
Rei to live in London?

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:17.450
I can no longer wait.

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:23.290
Even though I said
I would wait for him.

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:27.500
Yes, she said she would wait for me.
Because she said this, I am complacent.

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.670
And when I became busy
I ignored her.

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:33.500
Sensei, please give us your
opinions.

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:37.970
Everyone is so interested in Kurata-sensei's family.

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:39.340
So please, could we...

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:41.800
No problem,
wse all know very well...

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:45.060
No one is really related by
blood in our family

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:47.480
but, in comparison to some real
families

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:51.440
our love for each other is
stronger than most.

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.240
Come here, Namuru-chan.

00:18:57.860 --> 00:18:59.910
- Asako!
- Asako?

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:02.490
- Rei?
- Hey, there is Asako-san!

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:03.700
Asako...

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:06.200
Rei...

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:08.330
Asako-san...

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:12.960
Asako-san, are you leaving the
country for a film-shoot, or...

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:15.840
Ah, then, can we have a photo of
your family?

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.380
Please go ahead.

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:20.180
Shimura-san, Sagami-kun isn't here.

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:21.390
Yes.

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:23.890
What the heck is Rei-kun doing?

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:26.560
Could we please wait a little
longer?

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:30.940
Dammit! Why are you guys always
here at the worst moments?

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:32.350
Right!

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:36.070
There's no special reason, I just
want to leave the country to travel.

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:38.280
- Ah...
- Phone is ringing, Asako-san.

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:39.440
Yes, hello?

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:40.860
Asako, it's me!

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:42.910
Rei? Where are you?

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:45.660
- What is it?
- Ah, that is...

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:49.620
I can't reach him.

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:53.630
- Let us dine first.
- I will go prepare it immediately.

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:55.250
Let's watch some television.

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:56.500
Asako.

00:19:57.050 --> 00:20:00.920
We've been repeating our past
mistakes.

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:03.180
What do you mean?

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:05.930
At first, it was I who couldn't wait.

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:11.600
You said you wanted to be a true actress first. Back then, I was too impatient.

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:18.070
Now it is you who can't wait.
Didn't you say that you would wait for me?

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:20.570
But you have become impatient.

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:26.070
Is it really so impossible for
people to wait?

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:27.780
What are you saying?

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:30.950
Excuse me, but how much longer
must we wait?

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:34.920
I'm sorry, but there is one more
person who is not here.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:39.300
If he's not here, then today's
interview will have lost its meaning.

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:41.170
Ah, yes...

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.510
TV, wanna watch TV?

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:45.390
Here we interrupt with surprising
news...

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:47.850
Female star Asako-san is talking with an unknown gentleman...

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:49.720
We only know that he is
Kurata Sana's manager.

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:52.140
They're meeting at the airport,
the atmosphere between them is very strange.

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:54.980
- What are they doing?!
- So Rei-kun is at the airport!

00:20:55.650 --> 00:21:01.320
Asako, please let's start from the
beginning and wait in earnest this time.

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:03.150
Begin again?

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:06.780
Yes, I will wait for you to return.

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.030
And you will wait for me...

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:10.740
He's standing up!

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:13.500
...to go to London and find you.

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:16.960
What if we become impatient again?

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:20.500
We will worry about that when it comes.

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:24.260
Even if we repeat our past
mistakes it doesn't mater?

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:27.430
It doesn't matter, however many
times we do that.

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:30.140
Can this really go as we wish?

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:31.810
Of course.

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:35.560
Because we love one another.

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:38.610
Rei-kun, he's finally said it!

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:40.230
What an idiot!

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:43.280
Rei! Reporters, reporters.

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:46.320
I won't let them interfere with us again.

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:48.950
Kurumi Asako is my girlfriend!

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:59.130
Well... ok, I will wait a little longer.

00:22:00.590 --> 00:22:05.630
And we should be able to wait for
another two or three hours.

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:07.880
Alright.

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:11.220
Rei-kun, good job.

00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:15.730
And then, Rei-kun said goodbye to
Asako-san at the airport.

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:21.270
His car got towed for being parked
in the street. And the police scolded him.

00:22:21.690 --> 00:22:25.070
When he finally got home,
it was midnight.

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:32.240
But at last, the Kurata family got
a portrait to call its own.

